cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PX4 ROS 2 Drone Navigation"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 navigation stack for a PX4 quadrotor in GNSS-denied indoor, underground and open-sky spaces with no prior
  map: stereo visual-inertial or lidar-inertial odometry with relocalization and loop closure, a 3D voxel obstacle
  memory built in flight, a persistent D* Lite planner on a 3D lattice and a GPU MPPI local planner under a braking
  contract tied to the measured sensor range. Developed and accepted in PX4 SITL and Gazebo Harmonic by series of
  flights judged against the simulator's truth.
authors:
